    "preamble": "Govind Gurjar vs State Of Rajasthan on 6 October, 2018",
    "facts": "The name of the petitioner No.3 Laxman Gurjar S/o Shri Mathuralal Gurjar is deleted from the array of the petitioners of the bail application. The petitioners have been arrested in connection with FIR No.198/2018 of Police Station Bhupalpura, District Udaipur for the offence punishable under Sections 420 IPC, Section 7/16 of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1980, Section 80 of Trade & (2 of 2) [CRLMB-9739/2018] Merchandise Act and Section 63 of Copy Right Act. They have preferred this bail application under Section 439 Cr.P.C. Counsel for the petitioners submits that challan of the case has already been filed and no investigation is pending.",
